{"id":"b5fa7491a43dc01c","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-integral-test.md","title":"Cantor 空间上的有效积分检验","display":"df-integral-test — Cantor 空间上的有效积分检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-integral-test","aliases":["43-df-integral-test"],"display":"df-integral-test — Cantor 空间上的有效积分检验","depends_on":["[[43-df-effective-coding]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-effective-open]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-ce]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-integral-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-integral-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-integral-test — Cantor 空间上的有效积分检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]\">\\(t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(\\#_{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_2\">\\(\\#_2\\)</span> 与配对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 与非负 Lebesgue 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_{2^\\omega}\\!\\cdot\\,d\\mu\">\\(\\int_{2^\\omega}\\!\\cdot\\,d\\mu\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a> 的正式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputableOnCantor}(t)\\iff\\exists E\\subseteq\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(\\{\\langle\\#_{\\mathbb Q}(q),\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle:(q,\\sigma)\\in E\\})\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\;\\{X\\in2^\\omega:t(X)&gt;q\\}=\\bigcup_{\\sigma:(q,\\sigma)\\in E}[\\sigma]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputableOnCantor}(t)\\iff\\exists E\\subseteq\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(\\{\\langle\\#_{\\mathbb Q}(q),\\#_2(\\sigma)\\rangle:(q,\\sigma)\\in E\\})\\land\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\;\\{X\\in2^\\omega:t(X)&gt;q\\}=\\bigcup_{\\sigma:(q,\\sigma)\\in E}[\\sigma]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IntegralTest}(t)\\iff\\exists u\\in\\{v\\in[0,+\\infty]^{2^\\omega}:\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}(v)\\}\\;\\left(t=u\\land\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputableOnCantor}(u)\\land\\int_{2^\\omega}u\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IntegralTest}(t)\\iff\\exists u\\in\\{v\\in[0,+\\infty]^{2^\\omega}:\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}(v)\\}\\;\\left(t=u\\land\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputableOnCantor}(u)\\land\\int_{2^\\omega}u\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地闭合接口，用于把有效的非负总变差函数转换成ML检验；此处域是不可数Cantor空间，不能直接套用可数域LowerSemicomputable。下半可计算性使全部有理超水平集开，从而 Borel 可测；显式可测函数见证使积分在任意候选 t 上均不越域。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","