,d\\mu<\\infty\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2117,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-integral-test]] — Cantor 空间上的有效积分检验"},{"id":"afddf8e62e2b3b86","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]$；随机性与积分检验见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-integral-test]]。"}],"outgoing":["aa33e0ea8422ba2a","ab1ef7b1cac112c1","7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","8e999d59227f4a28","6c0559518cd32104"]}